    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Book","name":"Dungeon Expert Eric: Skipping the Tutorial to Solo the Dungeons [LitRPG, Mage, Weak to Strong]","description":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEric\u0027s the only one in the System apocalypse. Downside? Lonely. Upside: He gets \u003Cem\u003Eall\u003C/em\u003E the loot.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELeft alone on a demolished Earth after the System apocalypse wipes nearly all of civilization\u0027s creations off the map, Eric, skipped by the Tutorial, finds himself the first (and only) person to face the World Dungeon the System is shaping the planet into. Forget a difficult tutorial; with no tutorial at all, he\u0027s in the deep end, thrust directly into hell difficulty. What\u0027s an office drone engineer and former coffee gofer to do but level up, clear dungeons, and grow as strong as he can in order to best the Great Game?\u0026nbsp;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENot only that, but it turns out the Tutorial might not be as kind and helpful as he hoped. Given glimpses of the Tutorial, Eric quickly realizes that it\u0027s wildly inadequate, meant to spit out fodder for the Game to chew up for the delight of the faceless audience. Setting humanity up for failure? Not on his watch.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe Great Game is the greatest entertainment the universe has ever seen, and that means it\u0027s livestreamed. The Tutorial is livestreamed, the dungeons are livestreamed... and so is Eric. Given the largest platform imaginable, Eric sets forth to help his fellow humans by creating \u003Cem\u003EThe Practical Guide to Solo Dungeoneering\u003C/em\u003E.\u0026nbsp;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBut it\u0027s not going to be easy. The universe\u0027s viewers are mysterious, and the Great Game itself is full of thorns--and did he mention the hell difficulty? Eric\u0027s got his work cut out for him. And he\u0027s going to cut it down to size and send it back out into the world in manageable, comprehensible bites.\u0026nbsp;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDungeon Crawler Carl meets Solo Leveling meets Omniscient Reader\u0027s Viewpoint, with a little bit of Steve Irwin thrown in for flavor.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETLDR:\u0026nbsp;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E-Mage MC\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E-Dungeon Crawling SysApoc\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E-Weak to strong / progression\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E-Skills, spells, and lots of loot\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E-A dungeon guide (eventually)\u0026nbsp;\u003C/p\u003E","image":"https://www.royalroadcdn.com/public/covers-large/195767-dungeon-expert-eric-skipping-the-tutorial.jpg?time=1791745244","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.royalroad.com/fiction/195767/dungeon-expert-eric-skipping-the-tutorial-to-solo","potentialAction":{"@type":"ReadAction","name":"Dungeon Expert Eric: Skipping the Tutorial to Solo the Dungeons [LitRPG, Mage, Weak to Strong]","target":{"@type":"EntryPoint","actionPlatform":["http://schema.org/DesktopWebPlatform","http://schema.org/MobileWebPlatform","http://schema.org/AndroidPlatform","http://schema.org/iOSPlatform"],"urlTemplate":"https://www.royalroad.com/fiction/195767/dungeon-expert-eric-skipping-the-tutorial-to-solo/chapter/4042938/1-whered-everyone-go"}},"url":"https://www.royalroad.com/fiction/195767/dungeon-expert-eric-skipping-the-tutorial-to-solo","aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","bestRating":5,"ratingValue":4.86,"worstRating":0.5,"ratingCount":22},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"noct"},"copyrightYear":2026,"dateCreated":"2026-10-01T14:34:00+00:00","dateModified":"2026-10-11T20:00:12+00:00","datePublished":"2026-10-01T14:34:00+00:00","genre":["https://www.royalroad.com/fictions/best-rated?genre=litrpg","https://www.royalroad.com/fictions/best-rated?genre=progression","https://www.royalroad.com/fictions/best-rated?genre=comedy","https://www.royalroad.com/fictions/best-rated?genre=male_lead","https://www.royalroad.com/fictions/best-rated?genre=strong_lead"],"headline":"Dungeon Expert Eric: Skipping the Tutorial to Solo the Dungeons [LitRPG, Mage, Weak to Strong]","inLanguage":"en-US","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":{"@type":"ReadAction"},"userInteractionCount":4714},"isAccessibleForFree":true,"isFamilyFriendly":false,"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Royal Road","url":"https://www.royalroad.com/","areaServed":"Global","legalName":"Not Yet Media LTD","logo":"https://www.royalroad.com/dist/img/logo/rr-logo-square-silver-gold-large.png"},"publishingPrinciples":"https://www.royalroad.com/support/knowledgebase/114","thumbnailUrl":"https://www.royalroadcdn.com/public/covers-large/195767-dungeon-expert-eric-skipping-the-tutorial.jpg?time=1791745244","numberOfPages":188}</script>

