    <div class="col-md-5 col-lg-6 text-center md-text-left fic-title">
        <div class="col">
            <h1 class="font-white">Dungeon Expert Eric: Skipping the Tutorial to Solo the Dungeons [LitRPG, Mage, Weak to Strong]</h1>
            <h4 class="font-white">
                <span class="small font-white">by </span>
                <span>
                    <a href="/profile/219075" class="font-white">noct</a>
                </span>
            </h4>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4 col-lg-3 fic-buttons text-center md-text-left">
            <a href="/fiction/195767/dungeon-expert-eric-skipping-the-tutorial-to-solo/chapter/4042938/1-whered-everyone-go" class="btn btn-lg btn-primary">
