    </div><!--END REVIEW LEFT CONTENT-->
    <!--START REVIEW RIGHT CONTENT-->
    <div class="review-right-content">
        <div class="review-header caption margin-bottom-10">
            <div class="row no-gutters no-gutter">
                <div class="col-xs-12" style="width: 100%; max-width: calc(100% - 0px)">
                    <h4 class="bold font-blue-dark">What if DCC got a head start on the apocalypse?</h4>
                </div>
            </div>
                <h5 class="bold font-red-sunglo">
                    <span class="uppercase">Reviewed at:</span>
                    <a rel="nofollow noindex" href="/fiction/chapter/4084967">
                        10. Game Show
                    </a>
                </h5>
            <div class="review-meta">
                <span class="bold font-red-sunglo">
                    <span class="uppercase">by </span><a class="small" href="/profile/223676">AkumetsuTime</a>
                </span>
                <span class="pull-right date bold uppercase font-red-sunglo small">
                    <a href="?review=3274276#review-3274276"><time unixtime="1791502219" datetime="2026-10-08T23:30:19.0000000" format="U" >Thursday, October 8, 2026 11:30:19 PM</time></a>
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>
            <div class="review-content" id="review-content-3274276">
                <div class="review-inner">
                    <p>A solid progression LITRPG which explores a Dungeon Crawler Carl-like scenario, but the main character is accidentally allowed to run the dungeons before anyone else.&nbsp; I'm excited to see how he can turn this early lead into a long-term advantage and solidify his place among the top players!&nbsp; A fast-paced, high stakes action work where the MC has to use his wits to survive in a post-apocalyptic world.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        <!--START REVIEW FOOTER-->
        <div class="review-footer">
            
            <div class="btn-group btn-group-solid pull-right" style="float: right !important;">
                <form method="post" class="inline-block review-vote-form" action="/fictions/ratereview/3274276">
