</div>
<!--END REVIEW ITEM-->

                <!-- START REVIEW ITEM-->
<div class="review" id="review-3286505">
    <!--START REVIEW LEFT CONTENT-->
    <div class="review-side">
        <div class="avatar-container-general ">
            <img alt="Time Traveler Knight" class="img-circle" data-type="avatar" onError="this.onerror=null; this.src=&#x27;/dist/img/anon.jpg&#x27;" onLoad="this.dataset.loaded = 1" src="https://www.royalroadcdn.com/public/avatars/avatar-506545-AABAAB7jkRk.png?time=1790893762"></img>
                <div class="avatar-border Border-witching"></div>
                <div class="gem gem-40 Border-witching" title="Reputation Level 40"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="scores">
            <div>
                    <div class="overall-score-container">
                        <div aria-label="Overall Score">Overall</div>
                        <div aria-label="5 stars">
                            <div class="font-red-thunderbird star star-50" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div><!--END REVIEW LEFT CONTENT-->
    <!--START REVIEW RIGHT CONTENT-->
    <div class="review-right-content">
        <div class="review-header caption margin-bottom-10">
            <div class="row no-gutters no-gutter">
                <div class="col-xs-12" style="width: 100%; max-width: calc(100% - 0px)">
                    <h4 class="bold font-blue-dark">LitRPG goodness</h4>
                </div>
            </div>
                <h5 class="bold font-red-sunglo">
                    <span class="uppercase">Reviewed at:</span>
                    <a rel="nofollow noindex" href="/fiction/chapter/4100807">
                        13. A New Zone
                    </a>
                </h5>
            <div class="review-meta">
                <span class="bold font-red-sunglo">
                    <span class="uppercase">by </span><a class="small" href="/profile/506545">Time Traveler Knight</a>
                </span>
                <span class="pull-right date bold uppercase font-red-sunglo small">
                    <a href="?review=3286505#review-3286505"><time unixtime="1791675390" datetime="2026-10-10T23:36:30.0000000" format="U" >Saturday, October 10, 2026 11:36:30 PM</time></a>
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>
            <div class="review-content" id="review-content-3286505">
                <div class="review-inner">
                    <p>This story takes a pretty generic setting and adds a really fun twist. The protagonist gets to solo run the dungeon before the rest of all of humanity! Yes this is hard mode, but he's either lucky, protected from on high, or makes intelligent guesses enough to pick a class that can solo. Moreover being here alone gives him world firsts which is of course a stupid good advantage.</p>
<p>There is humor aplenty and enjoyable writing, but there's also grinding. What's not to love?</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        <!--START REVIEW FOOTER-->
        <div class="review-footer">
            
            <div class="btn-group btn-group-solid pull-right" style="float: right !important;">
                <form method="post" class="inline-block review-vote-form" action="/fictions/ratereview/3286505">
